# Outfit gear (R18): a little camera drone riding above the right shoulder: round body, four steel arms, accent
# rotors and a glowing eye facing forward. Friendly, so rounded.
name outfit_drone
grid 5
size 8 8 3
slot body SwatchMain
slot arm Steel
slot rotor SwatchAccent
slot eye SwatchGlow
beam 1.5 1.5 1.5 6.5 6.5 1.5 0.6 arm
beam 1.5 6.5 1.5 6.5 1.5 1.5 0.6 arm
ellipsoid 4 4 1.5 1.9 1.9 1.4 body
cyl 1.5 1.5 2 3 1.4 rotor
cyl 6.5 1.5 2 3 1.4 rotor
cyl 1.5 6.5 2 3 1.4 rotor
cyl 6.5 6.5 2 3 1.4 rotor
box 5 3 0 6 5 2 eye
pivot 4 4 0
